Contas da Bola (https://contasdabola.pt/)

Open data
---------
The JSON files under data/ are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The licence covers only this project's own outputs: forecasts, simulations and metrics.
Sports facts (fixtures, dates, scores) are given with no claim of rights.

Attribution: "Source: Contas da Bola (https://contasdabola.pt/), CC BY 4.0".

Excluded from the licence
-------------------------
- Third-party data, including bookmaker odds and everything derived from them, match
  statistics and expected goals. None of it is in data/.
- Club names, trademarks and crests (static/crests/), which belong to their owners and are
  used only to identify the clubs.
- The Archivo font (static/fonts/), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (static/fonts/OFL.txt).

Everything else
